{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_126_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_126_1000_012mam", "source_sha256": "cdfcd95449f322ab2858d4e293f935da1b330c81c7776107284ca9fce1d39bd5", "ja": "大変大変～！　いま廊下に、\nなんか強そうな知らないオジサンが\nいたんだけど！　フシンシャかな？", "zh": "不得了不得了～！刚刚走廊上\n有个看起来挺厉害的陌生大叔耶！\n难道是可疑分子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_126_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "c96e9293d9e349ec3fc40f8e99b31a587b91ee134b82cff2e58cbd8e7ebe4438", "ja": "ええっ、ホント！？\nど、どうしよう……。\nとりあえず、私も見に行ってみる！", "zh": "诶，真的吗！？\n怎、怎么办……\n总之，我也去看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_126_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "596741de1d759e0ed732024723c938f470bee9eb54572f7aeea8b3e9ef30d35e", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと待って！\nそういう時は、自分で確認したり\nしないで、まず連絡しなきゃ。", "zh": "等、等一下！\n这种时候不能自己去确认，\n得先联系别人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_126_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "a415bd1b46140afd38ac5d37e0e71adfcaf5862700b7730c5d5bf498042adfee", "ja": "それに、今回は大丈夫だと思うわ。\nその人はきっと……さっきまで\n一緒にいた、私の父だから。", "zh": "而且，我觉得这次应该没问题。\n因为那个人一定是……刚才还和我在一起的父亲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
